# Normalize line endings for the cross-platform contract tests.
#
# The platform-contract workflow runs `npm test` on both ubuntu-24.04 and
# windows-2025. Without this file, a Windows checkout converts text files to
# CRLF, so the two runners read different bytes for the same commit and any
# newline-sensitive assertion becomes runner-dependent (the Shared contracts
# windows-2025 job failed on 2026-11-05 while the identical ubuntu job passed).
# Pinning text files to LF makes the fixtures byte-identical on every runner.
# Added during the PR #571 Windows CI investigation.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries are never normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
*.apk binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
